      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You generate a sustained dark energy aura that continuously destabilizes everything around you.</p><p>You project a <strong>15-foot warp aura</strong> for <strong>1 minute</strong>. At the start of each of your turns, all enemies within the aura take <strong>1d4 void damage</strong> and must succeed on a <strong>Fortitude</strong> save (DC = your class DC) or become Flat-Footed until the start of your next turn. Dismiss as a free action.</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Warp Upgrade. Classes: Adept.</em></p>"
